{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moant\u5e7b\u89c6\u4e4b\u591c\u00a0</strong>is a short, choice-based narrative game about solving mysteries through time loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Moant Miller Edmund, a writer plagued by creative block, returning to the unfamiliar hometown of Dunckerton for my great-uncle's funeral. It was supposed to be a simple trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I am trapped. Trapped in the twilight of my arrival at Dunckerton Station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end, but another beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Loop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Choices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Time Events (Under Development)</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056320?t=1759030722","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056320/bdd02cd121a7e113a4c8a6050623d80dd421ee20/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759030722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056320/8eb086a099934c19cd01f905fe60af30cd19bc8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759030722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056320/8eb086a099934c19cd01f905fe60af30cd19bc8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759030722","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moant\u5e7b\u89c6\u4e4b\u591c\u00a0</strong>is a short, choice-based narrative game about solving mysteries through time loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Moant Miller Edmund, a writer pla